Description: VieLotusIM (Sen Viet) - Next-Gen Vietnamese Input Method (IBus & Fcitx5)
 VieLotusIM (Sen Viet) is a Pure Swift 6 Vietnamese input method engine with
 Smart Bilingual (English-Vietnamese) restoration and free-tone SEN Flex
 (Telex & VNI) support for both Fcitx5 and IBus on Ubuntu and Debian.
